This chapter shares only inscribe, caption, caption line and caption remainder.

Use the page library.
Use the foundation chapter.

To stroke at a left (number) by a top (number) with a width (number) over a height (number):
  Let the x be the left.
  Let the y be the top.
  Let the right be the left + the width.
  Let the bottom be the top + the height.
  If the x is less than 0:
    Set the x to 0.
  If the y is less than 0:
    Set the y to 0.
  If the right is more than 160:
    Set the right to 160.
  If the bottom is more than 144:
    Set the bottom to 144.
  If the x is less than the right and the y is less than the bottom:
    Let the breadth be the right - the x.
    Let the depth be the bottom - the y.
    Fill Screen from the x by the y with the breadth over the depth as 3.

To work out the plain letter (text) of a letter (text):
  Choose the answer by the letter:
    For "Á", "À", "Â", "Ä", "Ã" or "Å", use "A".
    For "É", "È", "Ê" or "Ë", use "E".
    For "Í", "Ì", "Î" or "Ï", use "I".
    For "Ó", "Ò", "Ô", "Ö" or "Õ", use "O".
    For "Ú", "Ù", "Û" or "Ü", use "U".
    For "Ñ", use "N".
    For "Ç", use "C".
    Otherwise, use the letter.

To draw a mark (text) at a left (number) by a top (number):
  Let the letter be the mark in upper case.
  If the letter is one of "Á", "É", "Í", "Ó" or "Ú":
    Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top - 1) with 1 over 1.
  If the letter is "Ñ":
    Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top - 1) with 3 over 1.
  Set the letter to the plain letter of the letter.
  Depending on the letter:
    For "A":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 6.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 6.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
    For "B":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
    For "C":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
    For "D":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
    For "E":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
    For "F":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
    For "G":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 3.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 2 over 1.
    For "H":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
    For "I":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 5 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 5 over 1.
    For "J":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 5 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 2 over 1.
    For "K":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 0) with 2 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 6) with 2 over 1.
    For "L":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
    For "M":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 1.
    For "N":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
    For "O":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
    For "P":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
    For "Q":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 5) with 2 over 2.
    For "R":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 6) with 1 over 1.
    For "S":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
    For "T":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 5 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 6.
    For "U":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 6.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 6.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
    For "V":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 4.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 4.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 6) with 1 over 1.
    For "W":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 1.
    For "X":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 2.
    For "Y":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 4.
    For "Z":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 5 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 5 over 1.
    For "0":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 1.
    For "1":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 6.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 5 over 1.
    For "2":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 5 over 1.
    For "3":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
    For "4":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 4.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 7.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
    For "5":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 5 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 3) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
    For "6":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 4 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
    For "7":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 0) with 5 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 2.
    For "8":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
    For "9":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 4 over 1.
    For ".":
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 6) with 1 over 1.
    For ",":
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 1 over 1.
    For ":":
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 1.
    For ";":
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 1 over 1.
    For "!":
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 6) with 1 over 1.
    For "?":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 2 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 1.
    For "-":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
    For "'":
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 2.
    For "/":
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 3) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 5) with 1 over 2.
    For "(":
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 0) with 2 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 6) with 2 over 1.
    For ")":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 2 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 5.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 6) with 2 over 1.
    For "♂":
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 6) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 2) with 1 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 3) by (the top + 0) with 1 over 1.
    For "♀":
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 0) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 0) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 4) by (the top + 1) with 1 over 2.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 3) with 3 over 1.
      Stroke at (the left + 2) by (the top + 4) with 1 over 3.
      Stroke at (the left + 1) by (the top + 5) with 3 over 1.

To inscribe a wording (text) at a left (number) by a top (number):
  Let the size be the length of the wording.
  Let the position be 0.
  Let the column be the left.
  Repeat the size times:
    Add 1 to the position.
    Let the mark be the first 1 letters of the last (the size - the position + 1) letters of the wording.
    Draw the mark at the column by the top.
    Add 6 to the column.

To work out the caption line (text) of a wording (text):
  Let the size be the length of the wording.
  If the size is at most 19:
    The answer is the wording.
  Let the next be the first 1 letters of the last (the size - 19) letters of the wording.
  If the next is " ":
    The answer is the first 19 letters of the wording.
  Let the position be 0.
  Let the break be 0.
  Repeat 19 times:
    Add 1 to the position.
    Let the mark be the first 1 letters of the last (the size - the position + 1) letters of the wording.
    If the mark is " ":
      Set the break to the position.
  If the break is 0:
    The answer is the first 19 letters of the wording.
  The answer is the first (the break - 1) letters of the wording.

To work out the remaining words (text) for a line (text) of a wording (text):
  Let the size be the length of the wording.
  Let the rest be the last (the size - the length of the line) letters of the wording.
  Let the trimming be yes.
  While the trimming is yes:
    If the rest is "":
      Set the trimming to no.
    Otherwise:
      If the first 1 letters of the rest is " ":
        Set the rest to the last (the length of the rest - 1) letters of the rest.
      Otherwise:
        Set the trimming to no.
  The answer is the rest.

To work out the caption remainder (text) for a wording (text):
  Let the first line be the caption line of the wording.
  Let the rest be the remaining words for the first line of the wording.
  Let the second line be the caption line of the rest.
  The answer is the remaining words for the second line of the rest.

To rosette at a left (number) by a top (number):
  Fill Screen from (the left + 2) by the top with 4 over 7 as 3.
  Fill Screen from the left by (the top + 2) with 8 over 3 as 3.
  Fill Screen from (the left + 2) by (the top + 2) with 4 over 3 as 0.
  Fill Screen from (the left + 3) by (the top + 1) with 2 over 1 as 0.
  Fill Screen from (the left + 3) by (the top + 5) with 2 over 1 as 0.
  Fill Screen from (the left + 3) by (the top + 3) with 2 over 1 as 3.

To caption a wording (text):
  Fill Screen from 0 by 96 with 160 over 48 as 3.
  Fill Screen from 2 by 98 with 156 over 44 as 0.
  Trace Screen from 6 by 99 to 153 at 99 with 3.
  Trace Screen from 6 by 140 to 153 at 140 with 3.
  Trace Screen from 3 by 101 to 3 at 138 with 3.
  Trace Screen from 156 by 101 to 156 at 138 with 3.
  Rosette at 0 by 96.
  Rosette at 152 by 96.
  Rosette at 0 by 137.
  Rosette at 152 by 137.
  Let the first line be the caption line of the wording.
  Let the rest be the remaining words for the first line of the wording.
  Let the second line be the caption line of the rest.
  Inscribe the first line at 8 by 104.
  Inscribe the second line at 8 by 120.
